                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>The patient shows a positive blood culture for gram-positive organisms, indicating bacteremia. Oxygen saturation is mildly decreased, suggesting possible hypoxemia. Lactate is within normal limits, indicating no current evidence of significant tissue hypoperfusion. Findings are consistent with early sepsis; prompt clinical evaluation and management are recommended.</td>
